#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..Caption
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:286
msgid "Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:304
msgid "\"BioSphere based on AIPlanet by Dave Kerr  is a virtual world "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:305
msgid "created with artificial intelligence for evolving organic life.\""
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:309
msgid ""
"Why do we want artificial intelligence?  It will make our environment "
"smarter.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:312
msgid ""
"Imagine a robot that can live in our world, that can think and function "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:315
msgid ""
"independently for its own survival, to aid and complement human beings.  To "
"do "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:318
msgid ""
"this, the robot would need to be able to cope with the extremely complex "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:321
msgid ""
"environment of Earth.  It would have to be aware of the weather when it is "
"bad, "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:324
msgid ""
"but be able to ignore the weather when it is favorable, and concentrate on "
"the "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:327
msgid ""
"task at hand, like building a house.  For example if we send robots to Mars "
"they "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:330
msgid ""
"will have to be able to survive the unpredictable environment of Mars, yet "
"still be "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:331
msgid "productive."
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:335
msgid ""
"Why do we need a virtual world?  The real world is too complex for modern "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:338
msgid ""
"computers.  A robots mind must be able to understand an abstract version of "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:341
msgid ""
"Earth.  Once it understands a simple model of Earth, we could increase the "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:344
msgid ""
"complexity of that model.  Once the robot understands that, we could "
"increase "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:347
msgid ""
"the complexity even more.  So, in a linear fashion, we keep raising the "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:350
msgid ""
"complexity of the model in accordance with the robots ability to "
"understand.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:353
msgid "Eventually, we will reach a stage where the complexity of the virtual "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:356
msgid ""
"environment reaches the same complexity of our own environment.  At that "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:359
msgid "point, the robot would be capable of surviving the physical world."
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:363
msgid ""
"Why do we need a virtual world for artificial intelligence?  Well, if AI is "
"just sitting "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:366
msgid ""
"around on your computer, in a bleak void, then its not going to be very "
"fun.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:369
msgid ""
"Also, understanding the weather (not just predicting it) and other "
"environmental "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:372
msgid ""
"influences could lead to improvement in global anti-missile defense "
"systems, "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:375
msgid ""
"which would prevent nuclear catastrophe.  So, if you believe every word I "
"say, "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:378
msgid ""
"aiplanet could prevent World War 3.  Isn't that a cause worth fighting for?"
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:382
msgid "Why OpenSource?  This project is not funded by a university or by a "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:385
msgid ""
"corporation.  It is made in spare time, and therefore must use OpenSource "
"tools "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:388
msgid ""
"such as GLScene and ODE.  If there were expensive, fancy physics engines "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:391
msgid ""
"and modellers available, ai.planet would use those.  To keep with this "
"spirit of "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:394
msgid ""
"sharing and free collaboration, ai.planet is stored on a CVS for anyone "
"with the "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:397
msgid ""
"talent to download/modify the codebase.  What is the point of developing a "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:400
msgid ""
"nice world for AI if only a handful of people get to play with it?  This "
"technology "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:403
msgid ""
"is for everyone to use.  Yes, there are many better virtual reality engines "
"out "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:406
msgid ""
"there, but as of this writing, ai.planet is the only OpenSource artificial "
"life engine.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:409
msgid ""
"If you enjoy this project and want to see it succeed then please contribute."
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:416
msgid ""
"asking!  Are you implying that if humans develop artificially intelligent "
"robots, they "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:419
msgid ""
"will form SkyNet or The Matrix and enslave humanity?  If so I thought "
"ahead: to "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:422
msgid ""
"avoid this scenario Ai.Planet is OpenSource, which means everyone in the "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:425
msgid ""
"world can have the code.  You can only take over the world if you are the "
"only "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:428
msgid ""
"one with weapons.  One guy with a gun always loses to a hundred guys with "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:431
msgid ""
"guns.  This is the most frequent concern people spoken to me about "
"aiplanet.  I "
msgstr ""

#. FormAbout..PageControl1..TabSheet3..rePhilosophy......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbAbout.dfm:434
msgid ""
"hope I have alleviated your fears about the future, to all those who are "
"worried."
msgstr ""

