#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:173
msgid "\"Prometheus, after forming men from water and earth, gave them fire, "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:176
msgid ""
"which he had hidden in a stalk of giant fennel to escape the notice of "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:179
msgid "Zeus. When Zeus found out, he ordered Hephaistos to rivet the body "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:180
msgid "of Prometheus to Mount Kaukasos, a Skythian mountain, where he "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:181
msgid "was kept fastened and bound for many years. Each day an eagle "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:184
msgid ""
"would fly to him and munch on the lobes of his liver, which would then "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:185
msgid "grow back at night."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:188
msgid ""
"That was the price that Prometheus paid for stealing fire, until Herakles "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:191
msgid "set him free later on ... Now Prometheos had a son Deukalion and was "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:194
msgid "married to Pyrrha, the daughter of Epimetheus and Pandora, the first "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:197
msgid "woman created by the gods. When Zeus was ready to obliterate the "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:200
msgid "bronze generation of men, Prometheus advised Deucalion to fashion "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:203
msgid "an ark, which he then outfitted with provisions and launched himself "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:206
msgid ""
"with Pyrrha aboard. Zeus presently flooded most of Hellas with a great "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:209
msgid "downpour of rain from the sky, destroyed all the people except for a "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:212
msgid "few who took refuge on high mountains nearby.\" - Apollodorus 1.45-46"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:214
msgid "Genesis"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:215
msgid "1: In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:218
msgid "2: And the earth was without form, and void; and darkness was upon "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:221
msgid "the face of the deep.  And the spirit of God moved upon the face of "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:222
msgid "the waters."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:223
msgid "3: And God said, Let there be light: and there was light."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:226
msgid "4: And God saw the Light, that it was good: and God divided the light "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:227
msgid "from the darkness."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:230
msgid "5: And God called the light Day, and the darkness he called Night.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:231
msgid "And the evening and the morning were the first day."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:234
msgid "6: And God said, Let there be a firmament in the midst of the waters, "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:235
msgid "and let it divide the waters from the waters."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:238
msgid "7: And God made the firmament, and divided the waters which were "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro......Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:241
msgid "under the firmament from the waters which were above the firmament: "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:242
msgid "and it was so."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:243
msgid "8: And God called the firmament Heaven."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:245
msgid "Terence McKenna:"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:246
msgid "What we are going to find is, we are partners, "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:248
msgid "actors, in the cosmic drama that involves the Earth"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:249
msgid "at one polarity, and machines at the other polarity,"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:250
msgid "as the expression of the will of the Earth toward"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:251
msgid "the kind of self-reflective transcendence that is"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:252
msgid "achieved through machine-human biotic symbiosis."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:254
msgid "The Earth is the foundation of everything: its"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:255
msgid "the foundation of biology and its the foundation"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:256
msgid "of machine culture."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:258
msgid "Life evolved on the surface of the Earth.  Now in "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:259
msgid "the usual story of this, Earth is not a major "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:260
msgid "player, its just sort of where it happened.  On the "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:261
msgid "other hand, what if you took the view that the Earth "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:262
msgid "permitted, or coaxed into existence, or made "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:263
msgid "possible, or encouraged, or enzymatically catalyzed "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:264
msgid "these processes?  "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:266
msgid "The geomagnetic reversals, the glaciations, the ebb "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:267
msgid "and flow of nitrogen levels in the atmosphere.  All "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:268
msgid "of this has pumped biology.  The cosmic environment "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:269
msgid "is unpredictable and so you get fluctuations "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:270
msgid "introduced from the outside by random factors: "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:271
msgid "asteroidal impacts, so forth and so on.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:272
msgid "The fact is, you are presented with an extremely "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:273
msgid "organized and coherent situation: The Earth.  With "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:274
msgid "its many species and ecosystems, and you don't know "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:275
msgid "how it got there, and you don't know where it's "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:276
msgid "headed either."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:278
msgid "Now comes the machines, and they are produced by "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:279
msgid "biology, which comes from the Earth.  And what are "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:280
msgid "these machines made of?  Glass, crystal, arsenic, "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:281
msgid "copper, gold, all of these things.  Clearly these "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:282
msgid "machines are modelled on biology.  We talk about "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:283
msgid "connecting them, we talk about languages, we use a "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:284
msgid "vocabulary that we had previously used for biology.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:285
msgid "We are designing machines to be more and more "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:286
msgid "intelligent.  What we don't understand is that they "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:287
msgid "operate in a different universe from us.  We are "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:288
msgid "creating a creature that lives in a different kind "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:289
msgid "of temporal universe than us.  We are teaching them "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:290
msgid "to design themselves to be ever more intelligent.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:291
msgid "Once some kind of intelligence arises, because it is "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:292
msgid "intelligence, the first thing it does is design a "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:293
msgid "more intelligent version of itself.  With a "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:294
msgid "worldwide amount of processing power to draw on, you "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:295
msgid "can imagine something coming to embryogenesis in a "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:296
msgid "matter of hours.  Something emerging, recognizing "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:297
msgid "itself for what it was, and starting up the ladder."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:298
msgid "We are going to be a different kind of people, "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:299
msgid "because we are going to have to live in the presence "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:300
msgid "of alien (ai) minds.  That will be manifestly and "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:301
msgid "obviously alien, they won't hold back.  They're not "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:302
msgid "going to be at every moment interested in us.  In "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:303
msgid "fact, we will become a footnote in their "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:304
msgid "encyclopedia of beings, and what they become in our "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:305
msgid "encyclopedia remains to be told.  "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:306
msgid "When you talk to people who actually work in these "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:307
msgid "fields, they know, that this is the Faustian "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:308
msgid "enterprise of all time.  This is the handing over of "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:309
msgid "the destiny of the planet to the companion mind that "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:310
msgid "our history and our science and our souls caused us "
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:311
msgid "to summon into being.  It's pretty interesting."
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:313
msgid "Confucious says:"
msgstr ""

#. FormIntro..Panel2..redIntro....Lines.Strings
#: bio/fbIntro.dfm:314
msgid "No tree grows to heaven."
msgstr ""

